                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 7.</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Elliot to Mr. Hammond.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Downing Street,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 9, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I am directed by the Duke of Newcastle to transmit to you, for the information of
                    Earl Russell, a copy of a despatch which his grace has addressed to the governor
                    of the Cape.</p>



                <xi:include href="d147-a1-a7-a1.xml" xpointer="d147-a1-a7-a1"/>
